{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NGKEUQcz37ByHpcPkgTKoR","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tnarrative_guidance: '所有 plan-016 跨家族生成器确认 depth signal 普遍存在；9-generator 评估强化 universality\n2\t  claim； framing 完全成立无需调整。原始 3 claims 完整保留，Claim 1 的 generalization 论据从 6-gen 升级到\n3\t  9-gen 跨 5+ 家族。 Differential depth response 在所有新家族中定性成立，cross-family reference model\n4\t  优势得到确认。\n5\t\n6\t  '\n7\timagined_experiments:\n8\t- name: feature_ablation_and_trend\n9\t  plan_id: plan_001\n10\t  description: '三部分分析：(A) 特征消融 full/reference-only/surface-only； (B) 每特征 depth trend\n11\t    线性拟合；(C) 深度分层 perplexity 预验证。\n12\t\n13\t    '\n14\t  expected_results:\n15\t    full_7feat_macro_f1: 0.832\n16\t    reference_only_f1: 0.738\n17\t    surface_only_f1: 0.774\n18\t    full_vs_surface_bootstrap_p: 0.001\n19\t    full_vs_ref_bootstrap_p: 0.0001\n20\t    h2_drift_features:\n21\t      entropy_mean_slope: -0.28\n22\t      entropy_mean_R2: 0.94\n23\t      ttr_slope: -0.045\n24\t      ttr_R2: 0.91\n25\t      hapax_ratio_slope: -0.062\n26\t      hapax_R2: 0.96\n27\t    h1_stationary_features:\n28\t      entropy_std_slope: -0.008\n29\t      entropy_std_R2: 0.12\n30\t      tail_decay_slope: 0.003\n31\t      tail_decay_R2: 0.05\n32\t      entropy_max_slope: -0.015\n33\t      entropy_max_R2: 0.18\n34\t    median_ppl_by_depth:\n35\t    - 13.5\n36\t    - 4.96\n37\t    - 3.0\n38\t    - 2.07\n39\t    - 1.72\n40\t    ppl_depth_spearman: -0.92\n41\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下，full ensemble 显著优于任一子集（+5.8pp over ref-only，+5.8pp over\n42\t    surface）， 证明 reference features 和 surface features 提供互补信号而非冗余。H2 drift features  展现\n43\t    R²>0.90 的强单调趋势，因为递归生成的 location shift 导致 mean/diversity 持续压缩； H1 features R²<0.20\n44\t    因为 shape 由 sampling mechanism 和 architecture 决定，对 input  content drift 不敏感。Perplexity\n45\t    随 depth 急剧下降（depth-0 到 depth-4 下降 87%）， 这是因为深层生成文本越来越可预测（mean NLL 持续降低）。\n46\t\n47\t    '\n48\t  tables:\n49\t  - name: 'Table 1: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV, Pythia-2.8B)'\n50\t    columns:\n51\t    - Feature_Set\n52\t    - Macro_F1\n53\t    - 95%_CI\n54\t    rows:\n55\t    - - Full_7feat\n56\t      - 0.832\n57\t      - '[0.818, 0.845]'\n58\t    - - Reference_only_5feat\n59\t      - 0.738\n60\t      - '[0.721, 0.754]'\n61\t    - - Surface_only_2feat\n62\t      - 0.774\n63\t      - '[0.758, 0.789]'\n64\t  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Feature Depth Trend (Linear Regression)'\n65\t    columns:\n66\t    - Feature\n67\t    - Slope\n68\t    - R²\n69\t    - Category\n70\t    rows:\n71\t    - - entropy_mean\n72\t      - -0.28\n73\t      - 0.94\n74\t      - drift\n75\t    - - hapax_ratio\n76\t      - -0.062\n77\t      - 0.96\n78\t      - drift\n79\t    - - ttr\n80\t      - -0.045\n81\t      - 0.91\n82\t      - drift\n83\t    - - entropy_std\n84\t      - -0.008\n85\t      - 0.12\n86\t      - stationary\n87\t    - - tail_decay\n88\t      - 0.003\n89\t      - 0.05\n90\t      - stationary\n91\t    - - entropy_max\n92\t      - -0.015\n93\t      - 0.18\n94\t      - stationary\n95\t    - - entropy_min\n96\t      - -0.19\n97\t      - 0.88\n98\t      - drift\n99\t  figures_description:\n100\t  - 'Fig 1: 7 features × depth(0-4) 折线图, mean±std, drift features 清晰单调下降, stationary\n101\t    features 近水平'\n102\t  - 'Fig 2: Perplexity by depth box plot, 呈现 depth-0>>depth-4 的急剧下降'\n103\t  analysis: '消融结果确认 surface 和 reference features 各自贡献独立信号。drift/stationary 分裂完美对齐\n104\t    location-shift 假说：central-tendency features 跟踪 mean shift，shape features 对之不敏感。\n105\t\n106\t    '\n107\t- name: cross_generator_evaluation\n108\t  plan_id: plan_002\n109\t  description: '扩展到 5 generators (Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B)，\n110\t    LOGO CV 评估跨生成器泛化能力。\n111\t\n112\t    '\n113\t  expected_results:\n114\t    logo_5gen_avg_macro_f1: 0.81\n115\t    logo_5gen_ci95:\n116\t    - 0.798\n117\t    - 0.822\n118\t    per_generator_held_out:\n119\t      pythia-2.8b: 0.82\n120\t      pythia-1b: 0.86\n121\t      olmo-2-1b: 0.77\n122\t      qwen3-1.7b: 0.81\n123\t      qwen3-0.6b: 0.83\n124\t    per_gen_f1_std: 0.032\n125\t    per_gen_f1_range:\n126\t    - 0.77\n127\t    - 0.86\n128\t    leave_one_family_out:\n129\t      pythia_held_out: 0.79\n130\t      olmo_held_out: 0.77\n131\t      qwen_held_out: 0.8\n132\t    family_out_vs_gen_out_delta: 0.015\n133\t    ablation_full_f1: 0.81\n134\t    ablation_reference_only_f1: 0.76\n135\t    ablation_surface_only_f1: 0.754\n136\t    top_features:\n137\t    - hapax_ratio_0.285\n138\t    - ttr_0.172\n139\t    - entropy_mean_0.165\n140\t    total_records: 22920\n141\t  result_rationale: 'best 档假设跨生成器泛化强健。5-gen LOGO 均值 0.81 体现了 depth signal 的 architecture-invariant  特性——递归生成的\n142\t    distributional drift 是生成过程本身的属性，不依赖特定模型。Pythia-1B 最高因为 与训练集中 Pythia-2.8B 同家族共享\n143\t    tokenizer/architecture bias；OLMo 最低因为 architecture  差异最大。家族级别 holdout 仅比 generator-level\n144\t    低 ~1.5pp，说明跨家族泛化 robust。 per-gen std 0.032 远低于单检测器 baseline 的 per-gen variance。\n145\t\n146\t    '\n147\t  tables:\n148\t  - name: 'Table 3: Leave-One-Generator-Out F1'\n149\t    columns:\n150\t    - Held_Out_Generator\n151\t    - Family\n152\t    - Params\n153\t    - Macro_F1\n154\t    rows:\n155\t    - - Pythia-2.8B\n156\t      - Pythia\n157\t      - 2.8B\n158\t      - 0.82\n159\t    - - Pythia-1B\n160\t      - Pythia\n161\t      - 1.0B\n162\t      - 0.86\n163\t    - - OLMo-2-1B\n164\t      - OLMo\n165\t      - 1.5B\n166\t      - 0.77\n167\t    - - Qwen3-1.7B\n168\t      - Qwen\n169\t      - 1.7B\n170\t      - 0.81\n171\t    - - Qwen3-0.6B\n172\t      - Qwen\n173\t      - 0.6B\n174\t      - 0.83\n175\t  - name: 'Table 4: Leave-One-Family-Out F1'\n176\t    columns:\n177\t    - Held_Out_Family\n178\t    - Macro_F1\n179\t    - Delta_vs_GenOut\n180\t    rows:\n181\t    - - Pythia\n182\t      - 0.79\n183\t      - -0.02\n184\t    - - OLMo\n185\t      - 0.77\n186\t      - 0.0\n187\t    - - Qwen\n188\t      - 0.8\n189\t      - -0.01\n190\t  figures_description:\n191\t  - 'Fig 3: Per-generator held-out F1 bar chart with CI whiskers, 展示跨生成器一致性'\n192\t  analysis: '5-gen 评估确认 Claim 1 跨生成器泛化。Pythia 家族两个成员（1B+2.8B）不造成显著 inflation—— leave-one-family-out\n193\t    delta 仅 1.5pp。为后续 plan-016 的 9-gen 扩展奠定基础。\n194\t\n195\t    '\n196\t- name: paraphrastic_comparison\n197\t  plan_id: plan_006\n198\t  description: '构建平行 paraphrasing chains 直接对比 continuation chains， 测试 attractor convergence\n199\t    理论——non-paraphrastic chains 是否保留更多 depth signal。\n200\t\n201\t    '\n202\t  expected_results:\n203\t    paraphrastic_3class_f1: 0.74\n204\t    paraphrastic_3class_f1_std: 0.009\n205\t    paraphrastic_binary_f1: 0.67\n206\t    continuation_3class_f1: 0.79\n207\t    continuation_3class_f1_std: 0.006\n208\t    continuation_binary_f1: 0.75\n209\t    f1_delta_3class: -0.05\n210\t    f1_delta_binary: -0.08\n211\t    depth_retention_para: 0.97\n212\t    depth_retention_cont: 0.83\n213\t    spearman_entropy_mean_para: -0.53\n214\t    spearman_entropy_mean_cont: -0.68\n215\t    spearman_ttr_para: -0.44\n216\t    spearman_ttr_cont: -0.63\n217\t    spearman_hapax_para: -0.46\n218\t    spearman_hapax_cont: -0.65\n219\t    drift_direction_consistent: true\n220\t    cross_transfer_para_to_cont_f1: 0.77\n221\t    cross_transfer_cont_to_para_f1: 0.74\n222\t    n_paraphrastic: 4900\n223\t    n_continuation: 4609\n224\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下 paraphrastic chains 的 depth signal 弱于 continuation 但仍可检测（F1>chance），\n225\t    符合 attractor theory 预测：paraphrasing 的语义保持约束加速收敛（retention 97% 意味着 depth-4 仍有 97%\n226\t    的 chains 产出合理文本），但 feature drift 幅度被压缩（Spearman ρ  绝对值低 ~0.15-0.20）。Crucially，drift\n227\t    direction 一致（同向负相关），说明 location-shift  机制在两种 chain 中同向作用，只是 paraphrasing 的语义锚定限制了\n228\t    shift 幅度。 Cross-transfer F1 >0.74 说明同一特征空间对两种 chain 都有效， 支持统一 depth estimation\n229\t    framework 的叙事。\n230\t\n231\t    '\n232\t  tables:\n233\t  - name: 'Table 5: Paraphrastic vs Continuation Chains'\n234\t    columns:\n235\t    - Chain_Type\n236\t    - 3class_F1\n237\t    - Binary_F1\n238\t    - Retention_d4/d0\n239\t    rows:\n240\t    - - Continuation\n241\t      - 0.79\n242\t      - 0.75\n243\t      - 0.83\n244\t    - - Paraphrastic\n245\t      - 0.74\n246\t      - 0.67\n247\t      - 0.97\n248\t    - - Delta\n249\t      - -0.05\n250\t      - -0.08\n251\t      - 0.14\n252\t  - name: 'Table 6: Feature Drift Comparison (Spearman ρ)'\n253\t    columns:\n254\t    - Feature\n255\t    - Continuation\n256\t    - Paraphrastic\n257\t    - Direction_Match\n258\t    rows:\n259\t    - - entropy_mean\n260\t      - -0.68\n261\t      - -0.53\n262\t      - ✓\n263\t    - - ttr\n264\t      - -0.63\n265\t      - -0.44\n266\t      - ✓\n267\t    - - hapax_ratio\n268\t      - -0.65\n269\t      - -0.46\n270\t      - ✓\n271\t    - - entropy_std\n272\t      - -0.08\n273\t      - -0.05\n274\t      - ✓\n275\t    - - tail_decay\n276\t      - -0.04\n277\t      - -0.03\n278\t      - ✓\n279\t  figures_description:\n280\t  - 'Fig 4: Paired drift curves (continuation vs paraphrastic) per feature, 展示同向但幅度差异'\n281\t  - 'Fig 5: Cross-transfer confusion matrices'\n282\t  analysis: 'Paraphrastic chains 验证了 attractor convergence theory 的预测（semantic preservation  约束限制\n283\t    drift 幅度），同时证明 non-paraphrastic continuation 是更优的实验设计选择， 因为它保留了更多可判别的 depth signal。两种\n284\t    chain type 的 cross-transfer 高 F1 支持 统一 depth estimation 框架的可行性。\n285\t\n286\t    '\n287\t- name: finer_grained_ordinal\n288\t  plan_id: plan_009\n289\t  description: '5-class ordinal 分类 (gen-0 through gen-4) 测试更细粒度 depth estimation 的可行性。\n290\t\n291\t    '\n292\t  expected_results:\n293\t    5class_macro_f1: 0.51\n294\t    5class_f1_95ci:\n295\t    - 0.5\n296\t    - 0.52\n297\t    5class_accuracy: 0.55\n298\t    5class_mae: 0.65\n299\t    3class_macro_f1: 0.79\n300\t    delta_5class_vs_3class: -0.28\n301\t    per_class_f1:\n302\t      depth_0: 0.92\n303\t      depth_1: 0.63\n304\t      depth_2: 0.28\n305\t      depth_3: 0.27\n306\t      depth_4: 0.45\n307\t    gen2_gen3_confusion_rate: 0.42\n308\t    ordinal_methods:\n309\t      CORAL: 0.5\n310\t      Frank_Hall: 0.52\n311\t      XGBoost: 0.51\n312\t    concordance_index: 0.82\n313\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下 5-class 仍然是 negative result（F1~0.51），但这完全符合 theoretical\n314\t    prediction： attractor theory 预测 depth signal 在 ~3 classes 后饱和。gen-2 和 gen-3 基本不可分\n315\t    （confusion rate 42%）因为 location shift 在 depth-2 后趋于 plateau——递归生成的  distributional\n316\t    drift 存在 diminishing returns。关键正面信号：concordance index 0.82  表明 ordinal ranking\n317\t    仍然 well-calibrated，即使 exact classification 困难。 这支持 3-class 作为 practical ceiling\n318\t    的 framing，同时 ordinal structure 的存在 validates depth as genuinely ordinal (not just\n319\t    categorical)。\n320\t\n321\t    '\n322\t  tables:\n323\t  - name: 'Table 7: Granularity Comparison'\n324\t    columns:\n325\t    - Granularity\n326\t    - Macro_F1\n327\t    - MAE\n328\t    - Concordance\n329\t    rows:\n330\t    - - 3-class\n331\t      - 0.79\n332\t      - 0.24\n333\t      - 0.87\n334\t    - - 5-class\n335\t      - 0.51\n336\t      - 0.65\n337\t      - 0.82\n338\t  - name: 'Table 8: 5-Class Per-Depth F1'\n339\t    columns:\n340\t    - Depth\n341\t    - F1\n342\t    - Most_Confused_With\n343\t    rows:\n344\t    - - gen-0\n345\t      - 0.92\n346\t      - gen-1\n347\t    - - gen-1\n348\t      - 0.63\n349\t      - gen-2\n350\t    - - gen-2\n351\t      - 0.28\n352\t      - gen-3\n353\t    - - gen-3\n354\t      - 0.27\n355\t      - gen-2\n356\t    - - gen-4\n357\t      - 0.45\n358\t      - gen-3\n359\t  figures_description:\n360\t  - 'Fig 6: 5×5 confusion matrix heatmap, 展示 gen-2/gen-3 的 heavy confusion band'\n361\t  - 'Fig 7: F1 vs granularity curve (2-class through 5-class), 展示 3-class 后急剧衰减'\n362\t  analysis: '5-class negative 是 theoretically predicted 且 narratively useful：它为 3-class  practical\n363\t    ceiling 提供 empirical evidence，同时 high concordance 说明 depth 确实是  ordinal quantity。Paper\n364\t    中作为 supporting analysis 报告，strengthen 了 framing 的理论严谨性。\n365\t\n366\t    '\n367\t- name: end_to_end_classifier\n368\t  plan_id: plan_012\n369\t  description: 'QLoRA fine-tuned Qwen3-0.6B-Base 端到端 depth classification， 对比 handcrafted\n370\t    distributional features。\n371\t\n372\t    '\n373\t  expected_results:\n374\t    qwen06b_5class_macro_f1: 0.59\n375\t    qwen06b_5class_f1_std: 0.005\n376\t    qwen06b_3class_macro_f1: 0.91\n377\t    qwen06b_3class_f1_std: 0.003\n378\t    pythia410m_5class_macro_f1: 0.56\n379\t    pythia410m_3class_macro_f1: 0.87\n380\t    per_class_f1_5class:\n381\t      depth_0: 1.0\n382\t      depth_1: 0.8\n383\t      depth_2: 0.41\n384\t      depth_3: 0.32\n385\t      depth_4: 0.44\n386\t    vs_xgboost_5class_delta_pp: 8.5\n387\t    vs_xgboost_3class_delta_pp: 12.4\n388\t    logo_generalization_f1: 0.72\n389\t    logo_vs_within_gen_delta: -0.19\n390\t    lora_rank: 32\n391\t    training_epochs: 3\n392\t  result_rationale: 'best 档下 E2E classifier 在 within-generator CV 上大幅优于 XGBoost（+8-12pp），\n393\t    因为 LM hidden states 能捕获 handcrafted features 无法表达的细粒度 distributional  shift pattern。但\n394\t    LOGO generalization 仅 ~0.72（比 within-gen 低 ~19pp），说明  learned representations\n395\t    过拟合于 generator-specific patterns。这是 best 档的 key  nuance：E2E 方法在 known-generator\n396\t    场景下 superior，但 handcrafted features 在  unknown-generator 场景下更 robust。这 validates\n397\t    paper 选择 interpretable features  作为 primary method 的设计决策——real-world 应用面对 unknown\n398\t    generators， interpretability + robustness > raw accuracy。\n399\t\n400\t    '\n401\t  tables:\n402\t  - name: 'Table 9: E2E vs Feature-Based Comparison'\n403\t    columns:\n404\t    - Method\n405\t    - 3class_CV\n406\t    - 5class_CV\n407\t    - 3class_LOGO\n408\t    - Interpretable\n409\t    rows:\n410\t    - - XGBoost_7feat\n411\t      - 0.79\n412\t      - 0.51\n413\t      - 0.79\n414\t      - ✓\n415\t    - - Qwen3-0.6B_QLoRA\n416\t      - 0.91\n417\t      - 0.59\n418\t      - 0.72\n419\t      - ✗\n420\t    - - Pythia-410M_QLoRA\n421\t      - 0.87\n422\t      - 0.56\n423\t      - 0.68\n424\t      - ✗\n425\t  - name: 'Table 10: E2E Per-Class F1 (5-class, Qwen3-0.6B)'\n426\t    columns:\n427\t    - Depth\n428\t    - E2E_F1\n429\t    - XGBoost_F1\n430\t    - Delta\n431\t    rows:\n432\t    - - gen-0\n433\t      - 1.0\n434\t      - 0.91\n435\t      - 0.09\n436\t    - - gen-1\n437\t      - 0.8\n438\t      - 0.63\n439\t      - 0.17\n440\t    - - gen-2\n441\t      - 0.41\n442\t      - 0.27\n443\t      - 0.14\n444\t    - - gen-3\n445\t      - 0.32\n446\t      - 0.27\n447\t      - 0.05\n448\t    - - gen-4\n449\t      - 0.44\n450\t      - 0.44\n451\t      - 0.0\n452\t  figures_description:\n453\t  - 'Fig 8: Within-gen vs LOGO F1 对比 bar chart, 展示 E2E 泛化 gap'\n454\t  - 'Fig 9: t-SNE of E2E hidden states colored by depth, 展示 gen-0/gen-1 清晰分离但 gen-2+\n455\t    混叠'\n456\t  analysis: E2E 实验的作用是 supplementary validation：(1) 证明 depth signal 确实存在于 hidden states  (upper\n457\t    bound)；(2) 证明 handcrafted features 的 generalization 优势 justifies  interpretable\n458\t    approach 的选择。Paper 中作为 \"ceiling analysis\" 报告。\n459\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"1451c1e1-cfa9-4438-b276-3ed5d963e54a","uuid":"b7adcaa3-f215-4be3-a122-39a141959246","timestamp":"2026-05-16T16:18:36.410Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/artifacts/dream_reports/dream_20260516T155725/best/review_context.yaml","content":"narrative_guidance: '所有 plan-016 跨家族生成器确认 depth signal 普遍存在；9-generator 评估强化 universality\n  claim； framing 完全成立无需调整。原始 3 claims 完整保留，Claim 1 的 generalization 论据从 6-gen 升级到\n  9-gen 跨 5+ 家族。 Differential depth response 在所有新家族中定性成立，cross-family reference model\n  优势得到确认。\n\n  '\nimagined_experiments:\n- name: feature_ablation_and_trend\n  plan_id: plan_001\n  description: '三部分分析：(A) 特征消融 full/reference-only/surface-only； (B) 每特征 depth trend\n    线性拟合；(C) 深度分层 perplexity 预验证。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    full_7feat_macro_f1: 0.832\n    reference_only_f1: 0.738\n    surface_only_f1: 0.774\n    full_vs_surface_bootstrap_p: 0.001\n    full_vs_ref_bootstrap_p: 0.0001\n    h2_drift_features:\n      entropy_mean_slope: -0.28\n      entropy_mean_R2: 0.94\n      ttr_slope: -0.045\n      ttr_R2: 0.91\n      hapax_ratio_slope: -0.062\n      hapax_R2: 0.96\n    h1_stationary_features:\n      entropy_std_slope: -0.008\n      entropy_std_R2: 0.12\n      tail_decay_slope: 0.003\n      tail_decay_R2: 0.05\n      entropy_max_slope: -0.015\n      entropy_max_R2: 0.18\n    median_ppl_by_depth:\n    - 13.5\n    - 4.96\n    - 3.0\n    - 2.07\n    - 1.72\n    ppl_depth_spearman: -0.92\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下，full ensemble 显著优于任一子集（+5.8pp over ref-only，+5.8pp over\n    surface）， 证明 reference features 和 surface features 提供互补信号而非冗余。H2 drift features  展现\n    R²>0.90 的强单调趋势，因为递归生成的 location shift 导致 mean/diversity 持续压缩； H1 features R²<0.20\n    因为 shape 由 sampling mechanism 和 architecture 决定，对 input  content drift 不敏感。Perplexity\n    随 depth 急剧下降（depth-0 到 depth-4 下降 87%）， 这是因为深层生成文本越来越可预测（mean NLL 持续降低）。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 1: Feature Ablation (5-fold CV, Pythia-2.8B)'\n    columns:\n    - Feature_Set\n    - Macro_F1\n    - 95%_CI\n    rows:\n    - - Full_7feat\n      - 0.832\n      - '[0.818, 0.845]'\n    - - Reference_only_5feat\n      - 0.738\n      - '[0.721, 0.754]'\n    - - Surface_only_2feat\n      - 0.774\n      - '[0.758, 0.789]'\n  - name: 'Table 2: Per-Feature Depth Trend (Linear Regression)'\n    columns:\n    - Feature\n    - Slope\n    - R²\n    - Category\n    rows:\n    - - entropy_mean\n      - -0.28\n      - 0.94\n      - drift\n    - - hapax_ratio\n      - -0.062\n      - 0.96\n      - drift\n    - - ttr\n      - -0.045\n      - 0.91\n      - drift\n    - - entropy_std\n      - -0.008\n      - 0.12\n      - stationary\n    - - tail_decay\n      - 0.003\n      - 0.05\n      - stationary\n    - - entropy_max\n      - -0.015\n      - 0.18\n      - stationary\n    - - entropy_min\n      - -0.19\n      - 0.88\n      - drift\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 1: 7 features × depth(0-4) 折线图, mean±std, drift features 清晰单调下降, stationary\n    features 近水平'\n  - 'Fig 2: Perplexity by depth box plot, 呈现 depth-0>>depth-4 的急剧下降'\n  analysis: '消融结果确认 surface 和 reference features 各自贡献独立信号。drift/stationary 分裂完美对齐\n    location-shift 假说：central-tendency features 跟踪 mean shift，shape features 对之不敏感。\n\n    '\n- name: cross_generator_evaluation\n  plan_id: plan_002\n  description: '扩展到 5 generators (Pythia-2.8B, Pythia-1B, OLMo-2-1B, Qwen3-1.7B, Qwen3-0.6B)，\n    LOGO CV 评估跨生成器泛化能力。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    logo_5gen_avg_macro_f1: 0.81\n    logo_5gen_ci95:\n    - 0.798\n    - 0.822\n    per_generator_held_out:\n      pythia-2.8b: 0.82\n      pythia-1b: 0.86\n      olmo-2-1b: 0.77\n      qwen3-1.7b: 0.81\n      qwen3-0.6b: 0.83\n    per_gen_f1_std: 0.032\n    per_gen_f1_range:\n    - 0.77\n    - 0.86\n    leave_one_family_out:\n      pythia_held_out: 0.79\n      olmo_held_out: 0.77\n      qwen_held_out: 0.8\n    family_out_vs_gen_out_delta: 0.015\n    ablation_full_f1: 0.81\n    ablation_reference_only_f1: 0.76\n    ablation_surface_only_f1: 0.754\n    top_features:\n    - hapax_ratio_0.285\n    - ttr_0.172\n    - entropy_mean_0.165\n    total_records: 22920\n  result_rationale: 'best 档假设跨生成器泛化强健。5-gen LOGO 均值 0.81 体现了 depth signal 的 architecture-invariant  特性——递归生成的\n    distributional drift 是生成过程本身的属性，不依赖特定模型。Pythia-1B 最高因为 与训练集中 Pythia-2.8B 同家族共享\n    tokenizer/architecture bias；OLMo 最低因为 architecture  差异最大。家族级别 holdout 仅比 generator-level\n    低 ~1.5pp，说明跨家族泛化 robust。 per-gen std 0.032 远低于单检测器 baseline 的 per-gen variance。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 3: Leave-One-Generator-Out F1'\n    columns:\n    - Held_Out_Generator\n    - Family\n    - Params\n    - Macro_F1\n    rows:\n    - - Pythia-2.8B\n      - Pythia\n      - 2.8B\n      - 0.82\n    - - Pythia-1B\n      - Pythia\n      - 1.0B\n      - 0.86\n    - - OLMo-2-1B\n      - OLMo\n      - 1.5B\n      - 0.77\n    - - Qwen3-1.7B\n      - Qwen\n      - 1.7B\n      - 0.81\n    - - Qwen3-0.6B\n      - Qwen\n      - 0.6B\n      - 0.83\n  - name: 'Table 4: Leave-One-Family-Out F1'\n    columns:\n    - Held_Out_Family\n    - Macro_F1\n    - Delta_vs_GenOut\n    rows:\n    - - Pythia\n      - 0.79\n      - -0.02\n    - - OLMo\n      - 0.77\n      - 0.0\n    - - Qwen\n      - 0.8\n      - -0.01\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 3: Per-generator held-out F1 bar chart with CI whiskers, 展示跨生成器一致性'\n  analysis: '5-gen 评估确认 Claim 1 跨生成器泛化。Pythia 家族两个成员（1B+2.8B）不造成显著 inflation—— leave-one-family-out\n    delta 仅 1.5pp。为后续 plan-016 的 9-gen 扩展奠定基础。\n\n    '\n- name: paraphrastic_comparison\n  plan_id: plan_006\n  description: '构建平行 paraphrasing chains 直接对比 continuation chains， 测试 attractor convergence\n    理论——non-paraphrastic chains 是否保留更多 depth signal。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    paraphrastic_3class_f1: 0.74\n    paraphrastic_3class_f1_std: 0.009\n    paraphrastic_binary_f1: 0.67\n    continuation_3class_f1: 0.79\n    continuation_3class_f1_std: 0.006\n    continuation_binary_f1: 0.75\n    f1_delta_3class: -0.05\n    f1_delta_binary: -0.08\n    depth_retention_para: 0.97\n    depth_retention_cont: 0.83\n    spearman_entropy_mean_para: -0.53\n    spearman_entropy_mean_cont: -0.68\n    spearman_ttr_para: -0.44\n    spearman_ttr_cont: -0.63\n    spearman_hapax_para: -0.46\n    spearman_hapax_cont: -0.65\n    drift_direction_consistent: true\n    cross_transfer_para_to_cont_f1: 0.77\n    cross_transfer_cont_to_para_f1: 0.74\n    n_paraphrastic: 4900\n    n_continuation: 4609\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下 paraphrastic chains 的 depth signal 弱于 continuation 但仍可检测（F1>chance），\n    符合 attractor theory 预测：paraphrasing 的语义保持约束加速收敛（retention 97% 意味着 depth-4 仍有 97%\n    的 chains 产出合理文本），但 feature drift 幅度被压缩（Spearman ρ  绝对值低 ~0.15-0.20）。Crucially，drift\n    direction 一致（同向负相关），说明 location-shift  机制在两种 chain 中同向作用，只是 paraphrasing 的语义锚定限制了\n    shift 幅度。 Cross-transfer F1 >0.74 说明同一特征空间对两种 chain 都有效， 支持统一 depth estimation\n    framework 的叙事。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 5: Paraphrastic vs Continuation Chains'\n    columns:\n    - Chain_Type\n    - 3class_F1\n    - Binary_F1\n    - Retention_d4/d0\n    rows:\n    - - Continuation\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.75\n      - 0.83\n    - - Paraphrastic\n      - 0.74\n      - 0.67\n      - 0.97\n    - - Delta\n      - -0.05\n      - -0.08\n      - 0.14\n  - name: 'Table 6: Feature Drift Comparison (Spearman ρ)'\n    columns:\n    - Feature\n    - Continuation\n    - Paraphrastic\n    - Direction_Match\n    rows:\n    - - entropy_mean\n      - -0.68\n      - -0.53\n      - ✓\n    - - ttr\n      - -0.63\n      - -0.44\n      - ✓\n    - - hapax_ratio\n      - -0.65\n      - -0.46\n      - ✓\n    - - entropy_std\n      - -0.08\n      - -0.05\n      - ✓\n    - - tail_decay\n      - -0.04\n      - -0.03\n      - ✓\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 4: Paired drift curves (continuation vs paraphrastic) per feature, 展示同向但幅度差异'\n  - 'Fig 5: Cross-transfer confusion matrices'\n  analysis: 'Paraphrastic chains 验证了 attractor convergence theory 的预测（semantic preservation  约束限制\n    drift 幅度），同时证明 non-paraphrastic continuation 是更优的实验设计选择， 因为它保留了更多可判别的 depth signal。两种\n    chain type 的 cross-transfer 高 F1 支持 统一 depth estimation 框架的可行性。\n\n    '\n- name: finer_grained_ordinal\n  plan_id: plan_009\n  description: '5-class ordinal 分类 (gen-0 through gen-4) 测试更细粒度 depth estimation 的可行性。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    5class_macro_f1: 0.51\n    5class_f1_95ci:\n    - 0.5\n    - 0.52\n    5class_accuracy: 0.55\n    5class_mae: 0.65\n    3class_macro_f1: 0.79\n    delta_5class_vs_3class: -0.28\n    per_class_f1:\n      depth_0: 0.92\n      depth_1: 0.63\n      depth_2: 0.28\n      depth_3: 0.27\n      depth_4: 0.45\n    gen2_gen3_confusion_rate: 0.42\n    ordinal_methods:\n      CORAL: 0.5\n      Frank_Hall: 0.52\n      XGBoost: 0.51\n    concordance_index: 0.82\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下 5-class 仍然是 negative result（F1~0.51），但这完全符合 theoretical\n    prediction： attractor theory 预测 depth signal 在 ~3 classes 后饱和。gen-2 和 gen-3 基本不可分\n    （confusion rate 42%）因为 location shift 在 depth-2 后趋于 plateau——递归生成的  distributional\n    drift 存在 diminishing returns。关键正面信号：concordance index 0.82  表明 ordinal ranking\n    仍然 well-calibrated，即使 exact classification 困难。 这支持 3-class 作为 practical ceiling\n    的 framing，同时 ordinal structure 的存在 validates depth as genuinely ordinal (not just\n    categorical)。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 7: Granularity Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Granularity\n    - Macro_F1\n    - MAE\n    - Concordance\n    rows:\n    - - 3-class\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.24\n      - 0.87\n    - - 5-class\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.65\n      - 0.82\n  - name: 'Table 8: 5-Class Per-Depth F1'\n    columns:\n    - Depth\n    - F1\n    - Most_Confused_With\n    rows:\n    - - gen-0\n      - 0.92\n      - gen-1\n    - - gen-1\n      - 0.63\n      - gen-2\n    - - gen-2\n      - 0.28\n      - gen-3\n    - - gen-3\n      - 0.27\n      - gen-2\n    - - gen-4\n      - 0.45\n      - gen-3\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 6: 5×5 confusion matrix heatmap, 展示 gen-2/gen-3 的 heavy confusion band'\n  - 'Fig 7: F1 vs granularity curve (2-class through 5-class), 展示 3-class 后急剧衰减'\n  analysis: '5-class negative 是 theoretically predicted 且 narratively useful：它为 3-class  practical\n    ceiling 提供 empirical evidence，同时 high concordance 说明 depth 确实是  ordinal quantity。Paper\n    中作为 supporting analysis 报告，strengthen 了 framing 的理论严谨性。\n\n    '\n- name: end_to_end_classifier\n  plan_id: plan_012\n  description: 'QLoRA fine-tuned Qwen3-0.6B-Base 端到端 depth classification， 对比 handcrafted\n    distributional features。\n\n    '\n  expected_results:\n    qwen06b_5class_macro_f1: 0.59\n    qwen06b_5class_f1_std: 0.005\n    qwen06b_3class_macro_f1: 0.91\n    qwen06b_3class_f1_std: 0.003\n    pythia410m_5class_macro_f1: 0.56\n    pythia410m_3class_macro_f1: 0.87\n    per_class_f1_5class:\n      depth_0: 1.0\n      depth_1: 0.8\n      depth_2: 0.41\n      depth_3: 0.32\n      depth_4: 0.44\n    vs_xgboost_5class_delta_pp: 8.5\n    vs_xgboost_3class_delta_pp: 12.4\n    logo_generalization_f1: 0.72\n    logo_vs_within_gen_delta: -0.19\n    lora_rank: 32\n    training_epochs: 3\n  result_rationale: 'best 档下 E2E classifier 在 within-generator CV 上大幅优于 XGBoost（+8-12pp），\n    因为 LM hidden states 能捕获 handcrafted features 无法表达的细粒度 distributional  shift pattern。但\n    LOGO generalization 仅 ~0.72（比 within-gen 低 ~19pp），说明  learned representations\n    过拟合于 generator-specific patterns。这是 best 档的 key  nuance：E2E 方法在 known-generator\n    场景下 superior，但 handcrafted features 在  unknown-generator 场景下更 robust。这 validates\n    paper 选择 interpretable features  作为 primary method 的设计决策——real-world 应用面对 unknown\n    generators， interpretability + robustness > raw accuracy。\n\n    '\n  tables:\n  - name: 'Table 9: E2E vs Feature-Based Comparison'\n    columns:\n    - Method\n    - 3class_CV\n    - 5class_CV\n    - 3class_LOGO\n    - Interpretable\n    rows:\n    - - XGBoost_7feat\n      - 0.79\n      - 0.51\n      - 0.79\n      - ✓\n    - - Qwen3-0.6B_QLoRA\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.59\n      - 0.72\n      - ✗\n    - - Pythia-410M_QLoRA\n      - 0.87\n      - 0.56\n      - 0.68\n      - ✗\n  - name: 'Table 10: E2E Per-Class F1 (5-class, Qwen3-0.6B)'\n    columns:\n    - Depth\n    - E2E_F1\n    - XGBoost_F1\n    - Delta\n    rows:\n    - - gen-0\n      - 1.0\n      - 0.91\n      - 0.09\n    - - gen-1\n      - 0.8\n      - 0.63\n      - 0.17\n    - - gen-2\n      - 0.41\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.14\n    - - gen-3\n      - 0.32\n      - 0.27\n      - 0.05\n    - - gen-4\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.44\n      - 0.0\n  figures_description:\n  - 'Fig 8: Within-gen vs LOGO F1 对比 bar chart, 展示 E2E 泛化 gap'\n  - 'Fig 9: t-SNE of E2E hidden states colored by depth, 展示 gen-0/gen-1 清晰分离但 gen-2+\n    混叠'\n  analysis: E2E 实验的作用是 supplementary validation：(1) 证明 depth signal 确实存在于 hidden states  (upper\n    bound)；(2) 证明 handcrafted features 的 generalization 优势 justifies  interpretable\n    approach 的选择。Paper 中作为 \"ceiling analysis\" 报告。\n","numLines":459,"startLine":1,"totalLines":459}}}
