{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01RuZZRqEKkEbupFQ9iep8Ri","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_3/projects/gen-depth-fingerprint/ROADMAP.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"## 核心方向\\\\n\\\\n> 最后更新: 2026-05-16 12:56 UTC | 更新原因: D038 定稿后全面更新：9-gen/6-family→8-gen/5-family，移除过时 phases，对齐 Reviewer critical\\\\n\\\\n递归 LLM 生成链展现 **differential depth response**：central-tendency/diversity 特征随深度漂移，shape 特征近稳态。7-feature ensemble 跨 **8 base-model generators / 5 families** 验证（D038 定稿：全部 rp=1.0 unfiltered）。**Primary metric (D017)**: binary LOGO F1（gen-1 vs gen-2+, leak-free）；3-class LOGO F1 supplementary。详见 paper_framing.md。\\\\n\\\\n## 投稿目标\\\\n- **主投: EMNLP 2026 ARR (DDL: 2026-05-25)** — ~9 天倒计时\\\\n- **策略**: 8-gen/5-family scope，D038 最终确定\\\\n\\\\n## 当前进展\\\\n- **阶段**: 论文数字更新（关键路径） + Gemma appendix 收尾\\\\n- **Main results 已完成**: 8-gen LOGO binary F1=0.694, 3-class=0.762 ✅\\\\n- **D038 定稿**: 8-gen rp=1.0 unfiltered main; Gemma rp=1.1 appendix only (rp-LOFO F1=0.518 FAIL)\\\\n- **Paper Agent**: 全文 scope+数字 Patch 进行中（6-gen→8-gen 更新）🔄\\\\n- **Gemma rp=1.1**: generation 进行中 (cuda:1, ~18% 进度) — appendix 用\\\\n\\\\n## 近期任务\\\\n\\\\n**最高优先级 — 论文数字更新：**\\\\n- [ ] Paper Agent 全文 Patch: abstract/intro/results/conclusion 数字 6-gen→8-gen\\\\n- [ ] 验证 discussion.tex \\\\\\\"16.9% depth retention loss\\\\\\\" 和 \\\\\\\"CV F1=0.781\\\\\\\" 来源\\\\n\\\\n**Gemma appendix（非阻塞）：**\\\\n- [ ] Gemma rp=1.1 generation 完成 → feature extraction\\\\n- [ ] Cross-rp analysis for appendix\\\\n- [ ] rp-LOFO 用修正 tail_decay 重跑（更新 appendix 数字，不影响 D038）\\\\n\\\\n**最终冲刺：**\\\\n- [ ] Round 5 内部审查 (submit_paper_to_review)\\\\n- [ ] 最终编译 + 提交\\\\n\\\\n## Claim 证据状态\\\\n| Claim | 状态 | 关键证据 |\\\\n|-------|------|---------|\\\\n| 1 — Depth Discriminability | ✅ | binary F1=0.694, 3-class=0.762 (8-gen LOGO) |\\\\n| 2 — Differential Depth Response | ✅ | 三档分类 D032, 3 ref models, 3 prompt types, length-controlled |\\\\n| 3 — Downstream Utility | ⬇️ 降级 (D029) | supplementary analysis only |\\\\n| Baseline comparison | ✅ | 7-feat ≈ 4-det+surface; 贡献在 simplicity + interpretability |\\\\n\\\\n## GPU 预算\\\\n- 分配: 4× RTX 5090 (autodl-5090: cuda:0-3)\\\\n- 当前: 1/4 活跃（cuda:1 Gemma generation），cuda:0/2/3 空闲\\\\n- Main results 计算已完成，剩余 GPU 需求仅 Gemma appendix + rp-LOFO rerun\\\\n- 已消耗: ~75h / 200h\\\\n\\\\n## rp-LOFO Gate 结果（D038）\\\\n- Llama proxy F1=0.518 → **FAIL** (< 0.60 threshold)\\\\n- 结论：Gemma rp=1.1 仅 appendix，main 报告 8-gen rp=1.0\\\\n\\\\n## 关键决策日志\\\\n\\\\n| ID | 日期 | 摘要 | 关联实验 |\\\\n|----|------|------|----------|\\\\n| D038 | 2026-05-16 | D038: 最终论文策略 — 8-gen rp=1.0 unfiltered main result | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-mistral-7b, plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11, plan-016-gemma2-2b |\\\\n| D037 | 2026-05-16 | D037: 撤回 D036 filter 策略。8/9 gen 不过滤（含自然退化），仅 Gemma | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-mistral-7b |\\\\n| D036 | 2026-05-16 | D036: 撤回 D035，恢复 Llama rp=1.0+filter。最终 8/9 rp=1.0 | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11 |\\\\n| D035 | 2026-05-16 | D035: D034 修正 — Llama 也需 rp=1.1。最终 7/9 rp=1.0 (原6+ | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11, plan-016-mistral-7b, plan-016-gemma2-2b |\\\\n| D034 | 2026-05-16 | D034: Plan-016 rp 策略修正 — Llama/Mistral 用 rp=1.0（退化 | plan-016-llama32-3b, plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11, plan-016-mistral-7b, plan-016-gemma2-2b |\\\\n| D033 | 2026-05-16 | Plan-016 策略：rp=1.1 新模型纳入 main results（9-gen/6-fami | plan-016-llama32-3b-rp11 |\\\\n| D032 | 2026-05-16 | Pooled ρ 修正 → 三档分类替代二分法: strong drift (hapax/TTR/e | spearman_per_generator, plan-014 |\\\\n| D031 | 2026-05-16 | H_min reclassified as drifting feature; shape stat | spearman_per_generator |\\\\n| D030 | 2026-05-16 | Round 3 审稿 3.0/Findings: 大幅重写 framing 为 base-model | review-p0a-gen0-leakage, plan-004-v2, review-p1c-qwen06b-instruct |\\\\n| D029 | 2026-05-16 | Round 3 审稿处理：大幅重写 framing (base-model scope)，downs | review-p1c-qwen06b-instruct, review-p1c-olmo-instru